- **Identity hint:** the tool thinks Jonathan del Strother appears under `<email redacted>` and `<email redacted>`. Merged, that is 16 lines (5.8%). Unmerged, one address has 13 lines. This is a guess from names and addresses until you confirm it. I did not write a `.mailmap`.
